From aa77a4b147bb19410c3d645811ca54771c93eb98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 03:44:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(guard): read Session.snapshotEvents after alpha.4 log API

0.1.2-alpha.4 removed Session.events. The fork-only todo-completion-guard
still walked the live log at turn-stopping; switch it to snapshotEvents()
and re-record pairing hashes for the merge.
